{"name": "Driving Rogue", "description": "<div class=\"game_area_description\" id=\"game_area_description\">\n<h2>About This Game</h2>\n<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Rougelike Arcade Experience!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Survive as long as you can, then spend your earnings to upgrade your ride and refine your build. Each run is a chance to go further, push your limits, and <strong>beat your previous best.</strong></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"426\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3088700/extras/3a89ee10a4897fb9cbae77a230d6f510.poster.avif?t=1787840326\" width=\"1170\"><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3088700/extras/3a89ee10a4897fb9cbae77a230d6f510.webm?t=1787840326\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3088700/extras/3a89ee10a4897fb9cbae77a230d6f510.mp4?t=1787840326\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Test your reflexes!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Push your reflexes to the limit in a <strong>high-speed arcade driving experience</strong> where every second counts. Drift through traffic, dodge incoming chaos, and chain near-misses to keep your run alive.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"658\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3088700/extras/a42b4e297f190e6f302e875e9fe34c52.poster.avif?t=1787840326\" width=\"1170\"><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3088700/extras/a42b4e297f190e6f302e875e9fe34c52.webm?t=1787840326\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3088700/extras/a42b4e297f190e6f302e875e9fe34c52.mp4?t=1787840326\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Procedurally Generated Maps!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The city never stays the same. Roads shift, traffic patterns change, and every run throws new challenges your way. Stay focused, react fast, and keep the momentum going - because <strong>one mistake ends it all.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"658\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3088700/extras/ffced170a217f2d3c02bf8548d99ecfb.poster.avif?t=1787840326\" width=\"1170\"><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3088700/extras/ffced170a217f2d3c02bf8548d99ecfb.webm?t=1787840326\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3088700/extras/ffced170a217f2d3c02bf8548d99ecfb.mp4?t=1787840326\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Customizable Cars!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Expand your garage with a lineup of <strong>unique cars</strong>\u00a0- each with its own handling and flair.\u00a0Personalise your ride with striking vinyls and stand out on every road.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"658\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3088700/extras/cfe9c2b43ddb9f6250e0da9a70f8b39b.poster.avif?t=1787840326\" width=\"1170\"><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3088700/extras/cfe9c2b43ddb9f6250e0da9a70f8b39b.webm?t=1787840326\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3088700/extras/cfe9c2b43ddb9f6250e0da9a70f8b39b.mp4?t=1787840326\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Hazards, traffic, weather effects, race modifiers!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The longer you survive, the faster and more intense it gets. Tight gaps, sudden turns, and split-second decisions will push your skills to the edge. Crash, and it\u2019s over. Start again, go further.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"658\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3088700/extras/a4b891af7a6cfa0e1b2cfcadcad50a77.poster.avif?t=1787840326\" width=\"1170\"><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3088700/extras/a4b891af7a6cfa0e1b2cfcadcad50a77.webm?t=1787840326\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3088700/extras/a4b891af7a6cfa0e1b2cfcadcad50a77.mp4?t=1787840326\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Highscore chase and leaderboards!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Compete for high scores, climb the leaderboards, and prove how far you can push your limits. No two runs are the same, and there\u2019s always a higher score to chase.</p> </div>", "short_desc": "Drift, slipstream, and chain risky near-misses at insane speeds to build huge combos. Adapt to procedurally generated streets and challenges, upgrade your ride, unlock abilities, and stack powerful cards to break records. Climb the Redline rankings and fight your way to the top of the leaderboards.", "header_image": "https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3088700/aeebb180049d0094f0e95f7f489bb3a52f9128b9/header.jpg?t=1787840326", "screenshots": [], "tags": ["Fast-Paced", "Arcade", "Indie", "Racing", "Difficult", "Controller"], "developers": "Gravity Works", "publishers": "Gravity Works", "release_date": "Sep 17, 2026", "price": "Coming Soon", "appid": "3088700", "